Adventure "The mysterious town":
    Begin at Entrance.

Scene Entrance:
    Narrate "Your car is out of gasoline outside a small, foggy town."
    Narrate "You need fuel or a place to spend the night."
    Option "Enter the town and ask for help" leads to TheTown.
    Option "Look for another route through the forest" leads to FoggyForest.

Scene TheTown:
    Narrate "A sign points to a garage. An inn is still open nearby."
    Option "Ask the mechanic for fuel" leads to Garage.
    Option "Spend the night at the inn" leads to Inn.
    Option "Return to your car" leads to Entrance.

Scene Garage:
    Narrate "The mechanic fills a fuel can and walks back with you."
    Proceed to RoadHome.

Scene RoadHome:
    Narrate "You refuel your car and leave the mysterious town behind."
    Narrate "Ending: Back on the road."
    Conclude.

Scene Inn:
    Narrate "The innkeeper offers you a room for the night."
    Narrate "You decide to wait until daylight to continue your journey."
    Narrate "Ending: A night in town."
    Conclude.

Scene FoggyForest:
    Narrate "The path divides beside an old signpost."
    Narrate "One trail follows a road; the other reaches a clearing."
    Option "Follow the old road" leads to OldRoad.
    Option "Explore the clearing" leads to Clearing.
    Option "Return to your car" leads to Entrance.

Scene OldRoad:
    Narrate "You follow the road and recognize the lights of the town."
    Proceed to TheTown.

Scene Clearing:
    Narrate "A park ranger waves from a cabin at the edge of the trees."
    Option "Ask the ranger for shelter" leads to Cabin.
    Option "Go back to the forest path" leads to FoggyForest.

Scene Cabin:
    Narrate "The ranger offers shelter and calls for help at dawn."
    Narrate "Ending: Shelter in the forest."
    Conclude.
